# One entry per shipped Rust worker. Format: worker=KEY,KEY,...
# Keys must be declared in .env.example. III_URL and AGENTOS_API_KEY are universal.
# Keep entries sorted by worker name; keep the two universal keys first.
a2a=III_URL,AGENTOS_API_KEY
a2a-cards=III_URL,AGENTOS_API_KEY,AGENTOS_API_URL
# Reviewed exception: agent-core receives channel secret values only for the
# current channel-readiness presence fallback. It does not use their values.
